{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mqlji214g5l","workspace":"/Users/imyu/Desktop/zonoid","title":"HTTPS cert setup runtime path drift","summary":"The runtime artifact migration redirects the daemon's default TLS cert lookup to the resolved .zonoid runtime data dir, but scripts/setup-https.sh still writes cert.pem/key.pem to ${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_DATA:-$HOME/.claude/orchestrator}/certs. A default setup run would generate certs where the migrated daemon no longer reads them, so HTTPS custom connector setup silently remains disabled until the script uses the shared runtime path helper.","created_by":"main","valid_from":"2026-06-19T23:08:15.688Z","vec":[-0.05141153186559677,0.0732761099934578,-0.03165498003363609,0.03533361107110977,0.0059915645979344845,-0.10417533665895462,-0.0721622183918953,0.021008038893342018,0.027056947350502014,-0.019549956545233727,0.0560411736369133,-0.014032009057700634,0.06310413777828217,0.02375166490674019,-0.005680822767317295,-0.017046194523572922,-0.001990559045225382,-0.021998530253767967,0.06271187961101532,0.0010976335033774376,-0.08040307462215424,0.020554069429636,0.0658629760146141,-0.0019698278047144413,-0.042904794216156006,-0.07913652807474136,-0.028370451182127,0.06795681267976761,-0.007554454263299704,0.03376509249210358,0.029437478631734848,0.06847527623176575,-0.12014918029308319,-0.036569640040397644,0.05682201683521271,0.11189437657594681,0.11248048394918442,0.03505872189998627,-0.058083269745111465,0.023281944915652275,0.21798571944236755,0.024762427434325218,-0.02521367184817791,-0.018998919054865837,-0.04484129697084427,0.020308170467615128,0.0016482425853610039,-0.130111962556839,-0.13736121356487274,0.004469842184334993,-0.025101162493228912,-0.002367631299421191,0.007669736631214619,0.005908810067921877,-0.044842712581157684,0.08564792573451996,-0.008047572337090969,0.14801907539367676,0.055666375905275345,0.015621107071638107,0.049911364912986755,-0.0013363331090658903,-0.06420813500881195,-0.01097386796027422,-0.023213321